  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每一点的坐标都是方程",
        "$y-x-1=0$",
        "的解。显然，双曲线和直线每一个交点的坐标既是前一个方",
        "程的解，又是后一个方程的解，也就是方程组的解。图象的两",
        "个交点是 $A(2,3)$ 和 $B(-3,-2)$。因此，方程组有两个解：",
        "$(2,3)$ 和 $(-3,-2)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程组的解集合是 $\\{(2,3),(-3,-2)\\}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这里用来解方程组的方法叫做图解法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "442",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "变量取值是 $x=3$ 和 $y=-1$，这对值是下列方程组的",
        "解吗？",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}2x+y=5,\\\\↵x^2+y^2=10;\\end{cases}$",
        "б) $\\begin{cases}x+2y=1,\\\\↵3x-y=10,\\\\↵x-y=4.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "443",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数对 $(3,\\frac{1}{3})$，$(1,1)$，$(-1,-1)$，$(0.5,2)$，$(-0.5,-2)$ 中，",
        "前一个数是变量 $p$ 的值，后一个是 $q$ 的值。这些数对中",
        "哪些是下列方程组的解？",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}p+q=-2,\\\\↵3p-2q=-1;\\end{cases}$　　б) $\\begin{cases}pq=1,\\\\2p-q=1.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "444",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知方程组的解，作方程：",
        "а) $x=2$，$y=-5$；　　б) $x=0$，$y=3$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "445",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用选择的办法找出下列方程组的两个解。",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}u+v=7,\\\\↵uv=12;\\end{cases}$　　б) $\\begin{cases}u+v=10,\\\\uv=21.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
